- Receive order confirmations.
- Access delivery information.

The administrator must be able to manage products, upload product images, edit company information, manage orders, update inventory, record inquiries, and maintain website content through a secure dashboard.

The website will be developed using Google AI Studio, connected to Supabase, maintained through GitHub, and deployed through Vercel.

### Primary objective

Create a professional, clean, modern, mobile-friendly online store that improves the business's credibility, simplifies customer ordering, and reduces the owner's dependence on Facebook-only selling.

Do not create a static mockup.

Build the actual application with functional frontend components, backend integration, database operations, authentication, and working routes.

